{"id":"santo-domingo","name":"圣多明哥","en":"Santo Domingo","country":"Dominican Republic","lat":18.472,"lng":-69.902,"dek":"美洲第一座欧洲城市的旧街与海风","history":"1492年12月，哥伦布在伊斯帕尼奥拉岛西北端登陆，把整座岛命名为西班牙岛。同年年底，一艘船在海地角附近搁浅，他留下三十九人，用沉船木料建起“圣诞节堡垒”。次年他返回时，堡内人已因强掳泰诺妇女被当地人杀死。哥伦布随后在堡东建伊莎贝拉城，这是美洲第一个欧洲殖民地，但传染病流行，数年后只得南迁。\n\n1496年至1498年间，哥伦布的弟弟巴尔托洛梅奥在奥萨马河东岸建起“新依莎贝拉城”。1502年，飓风摧毁新城，新总督尼古拉斯·德·奥万多下令迁到河西岸并筑奥萨马堡垒。此后这里成为美洲最古老且连续有人居住的欧洲定居点，也是西班牙在新大陆的第一处殖民统治中心。泰诺人被迫淘金、种甘蔗、养牛，反抗者遭杀害，天花更使他们在岛上绝迹。1586年，英国私掠船长德雷克占领并洗劫此城，索取赎金，城市元气大伤，首府地位被弃，人口大量迁往内地。\n\n1795年《巴塞尔和约》把岛东部让给法国。海地图桑-卢韦蒂尔一度夺下全岛，拿破仑军队随后反攻。1808年，当地反抗军在英国与海地援助下击退法军，重归西班牙。1821年，总督荷西·努涅斯·德·卡塞雷斯在此宣告独立，称“西班牙海地”，九周后即被海地总统布瓦耶占领。1844年，胡安·巴勃罗·杜阿尔特领导独立战争，多米尼加共和国宣告成立。此后数十年，这座城市是各方势力争夺的舞台。1930年圣泽农飓风重创城市；1936年至1961年间，它被称作“特鲁希略城”，独裁者被暗杀后才恢复原名。","culture":"旧城区自1990年起列入世界遗产。殖民区紧邻奥萨马河，以哥伦布公园为中心，16世纪早期的宅邸、教堂与修道院成片保存。肉身成道圣玛利亚圣殿都主教座堂始建于1514年，是美洲现存最古老的主教座堂；圣方济各修道院是美洲第一座修道院，如今残垣常作演出场地。伯爵门曾是城墙出入口，独立在此宣告，附近的独立公园安放着开国元勋遗骸。\n\n城市把历史收进博物馆：哥伦布宫是美洲最早建造的西班牙宫殿，皇家造船厂博物馆展出水下考古与海军史，皇家博物馆陈列殖民时期文物与画作，杜阿尔特故居讲述独立运动。周日傍晚，圣方济各修道院废墟常有乐队演奏梅伦格、巴恰塔与萨尔萨，本地人和游客一同跳舞。拉斯达马斯街被称为新大陆第一条欧洲街道，沿街老宅与石门仍看得出旧日格局。","pull":"新大陆的第一条街，仍在走人。","sights":[{"name":"殖民区","orig":"Zona Colonial","intro":"奥萨马河西岸的老城，美洲最早成片的欧洲街区，1990年列入世界遗产。棋盘路网与广场多保持原初走向，街宽只作微调。15、16世纪的宅邸、教堂、修道院与要塞集中于此，步行走完主要街巷约需半天，清晨与傍晚光线最好。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Calle_las_Damas%2C_Santo_Domingo%2C_Zona_Colonial.jpg/960px-Calle_las_Damas%2C_Santo_Domingo%2C_Zona_Colonial.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ciudad_Colonial_(Santo_Domingo)"},{"name":"圣玛利亚梅诺尔圣殿都主教座堂","orig":"Catedral Basílica de Santa María la Menor","intro":"美洲第一座主教座堂，1514年动工，16世纪中叶完成。石砌外墙偏金褐色，内部拱顶低而厚实，藏有殖民时期的祭坛与墓葬。它坐落在哥伦布公园一侧，是旧城最沉的一处空间，进内宜放轻脚步。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Bas%C3%ADlica_Menor_de_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa_CCSD_07_2017_4676.jpg/960px-Bas%C3%ADlica_Menor_de_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa_CCSD_07_2017_4676.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cathedral_of_Santo_Domingo"},{"name":"奥萨马堡垒","orig":"Fortaleza Ozama","intro":"美洲现存最古老的正式军事建筑，建于16世纪初，扼守奥萨马河入海口。石墙、瞭望塔与炮位保存完整，可沿台阶登上高处看河口与旧城屋顶。入口处有向导讲解筑城与殖民防卫的来历，值得跟着走一圈。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Fortaleza_Ozama_RD_11_2017_6495.jpg/960px-Fortaleza_Ozama_RD_11_2017_6495.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":768},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A5%A7%E8%96%A9%E9%A6%AC%E5%A0%A1%E5%A3%98"},{"name":"哥伦布宫","orig":"Alcázar de Colón","intro":"美洲最早建造的西班牙宫殿，属哥伦布家族，建于16世纪初。两层石砌建筑围绕庭院展开，拱廊与木梁朴素。宫内陈列殖民时期家具、挂毯与器物，从窗口可望见奥萨马河。它让人看到征服者日常起居的尺度。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Alcazar_de_Colon.jpg/960px-Alcazar_de_Colon.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%93%A5%E4%BC%A6%E5%B8%83%E5%AE%AB"},{"name":"国家万神殿","orig":"Panteón Nacional","intro":"由旧耶稣会教堂改建而成，安放多米尼加受尊敬的公民遗骸，是国家象征。内部中殿挂满吊灯，石墙与穹顶肃穆，长明火不熄。它位于拉斯达马斯街附近，参观免费，着装宜整洁，室内不宜喧哗。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/DOM_Santo_Domingo%2C_Ciudad_Colonial%2C_Pant%C3%A9on_de_la_Patria_0008.jpg/960px-DOM_Santo_Domingo%2C_Ciudad_Colonial%2C_Pant%C3%A9on_de_la_Patria_0008.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%87%E7%A5%9E%E6%AE%BF_(%E5%A4%9A%E7%B1%B3%E5%B0%BC%E5%8A%A0)"}],"foods":[{"name":"多米尼加炖肉","orig":"Sancocho","intro":"一锅慢炖的根茎与肉，常见鸡肉或牛肉配木薯、山药、玉米与南瓜，汤浓而厚。本地人多在午餐吃，配白饭与鳄梨。旧城与城市各处的家常小馆午间常做，分量大，适合两人分食。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Sancocho_de_espinazo_de_cerdo.jpg/960px-Sancocho_de_espinazo_de_cerdo.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sancocho"},{"name":"曼古","orig":"Mangú","intro":"青蕉煮熟捣泥，拌入黄油与油煎洋葱，口感绵密微咸，多作早餐或配菜。常与煎蛋、萨拉米香肠同盘，街头与市场早餐摊都有。它朴素便宜，是本地人一天开始的味道。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/Mangu_dominicano_--Contenido-_-Lonjas_de_salami_fritas_-Lonjas_de_queso_blanco_-Mangu_o_pur%C3%A9_de_pl%C3%A1tano_verde_-Mantequilla_--Este_es_un_plato_t%C3%ADpico_en_el_desayuno_dominicano_--Rep%C3%BAblica_Dominicana_-_2013-10-08_14-28.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":1286},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mang%C3%BA"},{"name":"炸肉块","orig":"Pica pollo","intro":"鸡肉切块腌后裹粉油炸，外皮脆、肉多汁，通常配炸芭蕉或薯条，挤上青柠。街头小店与快餐摊常见，按份称重卖，适合赶路时吃。本地人把它当日常快餐。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Pica_pollo.jpg/960px-Pica_pollo.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":758},"src":null},{"name":"三奶蛋糕","orig":"Tres leches","intro":"海绵蛋糕烤好后浸入三种奶液，顶部覆奶油，切面湿润，入口带奶香与轻甜。拉丁美洲常见甜点，圣多明各的咖啡馆与面包店多有冷藏出售，配一杯黑咖啡正好。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Pastel_de_Tres_Leches.jpg/960px-Pastel_de_Tres_Leches.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tres_leches_cake"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Aerial_view_Ciudad_Colonial_Santo_Domingo_09_2019_0067.jpg/1280px-Aerial_view_Ciudad_Colonial_Santo_Domingo_09_2019_0067.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":853},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Bas%C3%ADlica_Menor_de_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa_SD_RD_02_2017_1941.jpg/1280px-Bas%C3%ADlica_Menor_de_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa_SD_RD_02_2017_1941.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":842}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-69.9992758,18.505005],[-69.9988575,18.5027695],[-69.982309,18.4902597],[-69.9717952,18.4802026],[-69.9676299,18.4789757],[-69.9690238,18.4622282],[-69.9739531,18.4512485],[-69.9731139,18.4498168],[-69.975667,18.4477736],[-69.9796772,18.4396581],[-69.9843695,18.4340414],[-69.990145,18.4291032],[-69.9887258,18.4226572],[-69.9822013,18.4259469],[-69.9713203,18.4264243],[-69.9540081,18.4320554],[-69.9518577,18.4317802],[-69.9440777,18.4337641],[-69.9396665,18.4364962],[-69.9349902,18.4377739],[-69.9274917,18.4427369],[-69.9233459,18.4469992],[-69.920909,18.4523879],[-69.9157517,18.4555317],[-69.8982823,18.4614643],[-69.8934689,18.4643708],[-69.8911471,18.4638528],[-69.8921139,18.4650795],[-69.8889699,18.4676813],[-69.8860109,18.4684528],[-69.8835489,18.4667175],[-69.8793554,18.4710613],[-69.8824424,18.4808031],[-69.8824474,18.487335],[-69.8811403,18.4907274],[-69.8765802,18.4950405],[-69.8745128,18.4986253],[-69.8759475,18.5046896],[-69.8782671,18.5076218],[-69.8878019,18.5122035],[-69.8975494,18.5144262],[-69.9024676,18.5108675],[-69.9064835,18.5096756],[-69.914801,18.5105129],[-69.9214467,18.5095788],[-69.9305609,18.5141846],[-69.9323994,18.5165425],[-69.9324573,18.5185965],[-69.9363048,18.5207782],[-69.9408878,18.5193139],[-69.9456994,18.5140349],[-69.9495284,18.5147669],[-69.9569566,18.5190172],[-69.960192,18.5226545],[-69.9606169,18.52891],[-69.9591141,18.5320075],[-69.9599839,18.5357582],[-69.9620772,18.5366762],[-69.961875,18.5394786],[-69.963824,18.5410165],[-69.9660815,18.5413073],[-69.9683559,18.544487],[-69.9719351,18.5443196],[-69.971967,18.5457555],[-69.974904,18.5452872],[-69.9803626,18.5475893],[-69.9820744,18.5429017],[-69.9867597,18.5443147],[-69.9867963,18.5425908],[-69.9893718,18.5431378],[-69.9919203,18.5413608],[-69.9897981,18.5360176],[-69.992141,18.5350587],[-69.9903154,18.5333141],[-69.9901393,18.5305226],[-69.9920811,18.5303145],[-69.9952711,18.5272548],[-69.9928298,18.5233105],[-69.9896154,18.523475],[-69.9895921,18.5120642],[-69.9914